        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the whimsical world of Bunnies &amp; Ballgames! This delightful sports game invites you to become an adorable woodland critter and compete on the soccer field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Selection: Choose from a lovable lineup of cute bunnies and playful squirrels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/7c3c84a409cd126060850c74f5ab4fa6.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Gameplay: Navigate through challenging environmental hazards like slippery mud puddles and pesky rocks that will test your skills and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/0a0b58c52589ef5da4f653dc7b46431d.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Venture into the critters' home to discover hidden powerup foods that increase your speed and give you the advantage during games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/f671297461cc435c7005bc8e1e562b25.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the whimsical world of Bunnies &amp; Ballgames! This delightful sports game invites you to become an adorable woodland critter and compete on the soccer field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Selection: Choose from a lovable lineup of cute bunnies and playful squirrels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/7c3c84a409cd126060850c74f5ab4fa6.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Gameplay: Navigate through challenging environmental hazards like slippery mud puddles and pesky rocks that will test your skills and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/0a0b58c52589ef5da4f653dc7b46431d.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Venture into the critters' home to discover hidden powerup foods that increase your speed and give you the advantage during games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/f671297461cc435c7005bc8e1e562b25.avif?t=1782352818\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Play ballgames as adorable bunnies and squirrels in this whimsical, mysterious world where you must navigate tricky obstacles, dodge slippery hazards, and explore hidden areas to find power-up foods and uncover the meadow’s secrets!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
